## Deploy

```bash
# Initialise providers and modules
terraform init

# Preview changes
terraform plan
```

Then provision **in this order, one resource at a time** — wait for each apply to
finish and the resource to reach ACTIVE before starting the next. ODB provisioning
is sequential: a bare `terraform apply` would start every resource at once, which
is not supported.

```bash
# 1 — Exadata Infrastructure
{% for i in infras %}
terraform apply -target='module.aws_exadata_infra["{{ i.module_name }}"]'
{% endfor %}

# 2 — ODB Network
{% for n in networks %}
terraform apply -target='module.aws_odb_network["{{ n.module_name }}"]'
{% endfor %}
{% if peerings %}

# 3 — ODB Peering
{% for p in peerings %}
terraform apply -target='module.aws_peering["{{ p.module_name }}"]'
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if clusters or avmclusters or avmclusters_arn %}

# 4 — VM / Autonomous VM Clusters
{% for c in clusters %}
terraform apply -target='module.aws_vm_cluster["{{ c.module_name }}"]'
{% endfor %}
{% for av in avmclusters %}
terraform apply -target='module.aws_avmcluster["{{ av.module_name }}"]'
{% endfor %}
{% for av in avmclusters_arn %}
terraform apply -target='module.aws_avmcluster_arn["{{ av.module_name }}"]'
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if adb_integration %}

# 5 — Secrets Manager integration (account + Region)
terraform apply -target='module.aws_adb_secrets_integration'
# Then, outside Terraform: an IAM role trusting the role_arn output, allowed to
# read each ADMIN-password secret.
{% endif %}
{% if adbs %}

# 6 — Autonomous Databases (Serverless)
{% for a in adbs %}
terraform apply -target='module.aws_autonomous_db["{{ a.module_name }}"]'
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if ram_shares %}

# 7 — AWS RAM resource shares (after the resources they share are ACTIVE)
# Prerequisite, once, from the management account:
#   aws ram enable-sharing-with-aws-organization
{% for r in ram_shares %}
terraform apply -target='module.aws_ram_share["{{ r.module_name }}"]'
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

# Confirm nothing is left outstanding
terraform plan
```
